WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.700
Here's where it matters most.

2
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:06.338
A Global Administrator can rewrite the
policies that protect everyone else.

3
00:00:06.338 --> 00:00:12.363
If that role is always on, it's
exposed all 8,760 hours of the year.

4
00:00:12.363 --> 00:00:15.878
NSA and CISA rank weak
separation of admin privilege

5
00:00:15.878 --> 00:00:18.925
second among the
misconfigurations they find.

6
00:00:18.925 --> 00:00:22.516
And it's not only people; Midnight
Blizzard used a forgotten

7
00:00:22.516 --> 00:00:25.813
application with standing
access to reach mailboxes.

8
00:00:25.813 --> 00:00:28.112
A FIDO2 key proves who you are.

9
00:00:28.112 --> 00:00:31.038
It doesn't limit what you
can do, or for how long.

10
00:00:31.038 --> 00:00:33.697
So the decision: every human admin role is

11
00:00:33.697 --> 00:00:36.825
eligible and activated
just in time through PIM.

12
00:00:36.825 --> 00:00:38.299
The CISO sets that model,

13
00:00:38.299 --> 00:00:42.300
and the authorizing official accepts
whatever has to stay standing.

14
00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:44.090
Next, what the rules ask.
